        "created_at": "2012-06-02T15:16:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;arenson9&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"arenson9\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Alex\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/alex/48/2059_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Alex:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Wasn’t there talk at some point about possibly making a few of these superheroes’ comics? Maybe I’m thinking of something else.<br>\nIt could be a fun way to tell the character bios… giving each hero and villain a short comic that introduces them…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>There was a group Kickstarter award that was reached such that the Freedom Four Annual <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#1</span> comic will be produced as a PDF.</p>\n<p>Beyond that, as much as everyone agrees it would be a cool idea, producing the comics has not yet turned into a reality.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah!! But like I asked before, will it be exclusive to that group of supporters, or freely distributed and maybe that group gets a limited edition hardcopy printed?</p>",
